Z||000059||Fierowrecker||09-11-2001||10:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Boomtastic:<BR><B>I'm all for it. Hell - make it a public event. That should deter people from doing the crime in the first place ..<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Like the terrorists?<BR>Seems they think they would become martyrs by dieing for what they believe in...<BR>Death is not a deterent to crime, nor is any form of punishment...<BR>Most criminals do not ever think they will be caught, and a few never do...<BR>Fortunately, most are not that smart, and the cops trip over them in their investigation of the crime...<BR>I am NOT saying cops are dumb! Just over worked and it is difficult with all these tv shows educating criminals on how to destroy evidence!<P>If you were wondering what I think ought to be done with the cowardly, hide behind women and babies, terrorists, well, I do believe in locking them up in the same room and forgetting about them... <BR>After a while, there would only be one...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
Z||000060||Spiff||09-11-2001||11:20 PM||||I think they should have a time limit on being on death row (1 Year) then after your time is up put the execution on TV (Pay Per View). That way we would not have to build new prisons every other year. That may be a deterrent to crime. That's my take on the death penalty. <P>An eye for an eye.<BR>||||reg||1
